+# Captured with the stall watchdog: PUT = GET = 0x161af6c with the snapshot holding
+# 0x161af64, unchanged across eight samples 40 seconds apart, every other guest thread
+# blocked and the ring drained. The game does its own FIFO management -- it imports no
+# cellGcmFlush or cellGcmFinish -- so there is no HLE call to fix this behind.
